        "id": 1003966
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-03-01T21:31:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should presumably always be true due to the selabel_partial_match call on line 1657, right?\n\nPerhaps there\u0027s a way to eliminate the code on line 1657 and instead always use this function? This would avoid doing essentially two lookups, one on 1657, and one on 1668.",
