      "writtenOn": "2019-03-01T21:31:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIRC, the order of the entries in file_contexts is meaningful. If multiple regexes apply, the last entry is the appropriate one. So sorting this *may* be problematic. I\u0027m not sure.",
      "revId": "6410782727f8c1a4b5fdcac1988c659019a80a91",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
